{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Create a fully responsive Shopify Liquid section called “More Categories – Expandable Series Product Explorer”.
    
    IMPORTANT: This must be a **single-page expandable section**.
    Do NOT use a modal, popup, overlay, drawer, separate page, or page redirect.
    
    When a customer clicks a Series card, the corresponding product content must **expand downward directly underneath the More Categories cards on the same page**, similar to an accordion/expandable product explorer.
    
    ---
    
    ## 1. MORE CATEGORIES
    
    Create a horizontal section titled:
    
    **MORE CATEGORIES**
    
    Display these 7 Series:
    
    1. Urban Carry
    2. Craft Heritage
    3. Travel Movement
    4. Professional
    5. Essential
    6. Make It Personal
    7. Craft Innovation
    
    Each Series card must have:
    
    * Large Shopify image
    * Rounded corners
    * Series name positioned at the bottom-left
    * Subtle dark gradient at the bottom
    * Premium fashion/lifestyle aesthetic
    * Smooth image zoom on hover
    * Clickable card
    
    Desktop:
    
    * Display all 7 cards in one horizontal row.
    
    Mobile:
    
    * Cards become horizontally scrollable/swipeable.
    
    All Series images must be editable through the Shopify Theme Editor.
    
    ---
    
    # 2. SERIES CLICK = EXPAND DOWNWARD
    
    IMPORTANT:
    
    When the customer clicks a Series card such as:
    
    **URBAN CARRY**
    
    DO NOT open a popup.
    
    DO NOT create an overlay.
    
    DO NOT redirect to another page.
    
    DO NOT change the URL.
    
    Instead, expand the selected Series content **directly underneath the More Categories card row**.
    
    Example:
    
    MORE CATEGORIES
    
    [ Urban Carry ] [ Craft Heritage ] [ Travel Movement ] ...
    
    ↓ Customer clicks Urban Carry
    
    MORE CATEGORIES
    
    [ Urban Carry ] [ Craft Heritage ] [ Travel Movement ] ...
    
    ──────────────────────────────────
    
    URBAN CARRY
    
    Carry Smart. Live Urban.
    
    BAG                                      View all
    
    [ Product ] [ Product ] [ Product ] [ Product ]
    
    BACKPACK                                 View all
    
    [ Product ] [ Product ] [ Product ] [ Product ]
    
    BELT                                     View all
    
    [ Product ] [ Product ] [ Product ] [ Product ]
    
    WALLET                                   View all
    
    [ Product ] [ Product ] [ Product ] [ Product ]
    
    ──────────────────────────────────
    
    The expanded content should feel like part of the same webpage, NOT like a popup.
    
    ---
    
    # 3. EXPAND / COLLAPSE BEHAVIOUR
    
    Use Vanilla JavaScript.
    
    When a Series card is clicked:
    
    1. Expand its corresponding content below the Series cards.
    2. Smoothly animate the expansion.
    3. Show only the selected Series content.
    4. Hide the previously selected Series content.
    5. Do not reload the page.
    6. Do not navigate to another URL.
    7. Do not open a modal.
    8. Do not darken the page background.
    9. Do not lock page scrolling.
    
    If the user clicks the same Series again:
    
    → Collapse the content.
    
    If the user clicks another Series:
    
    → Smoothly collapse the current content and expand the newly selected Series.
    
    Use an elegant height/opacity transition.
    
    The expanded content should remain within the normal document flow.
    
    ---
    
    # 4. EXPANDED SERIES HEADER
    
    At the top of the expanded content, display:
    
    SERIES NAME
    
    Example:
    
    **URBAN CARRY**
    
    *Carry Smart. Live Urban.*
    
    Include:
    
    * Large elegant typography
    * Series description
    * Optional accent color
    * Close/collapse button such as “−” or “Close”
    * Clean premium spacing
    
    The expanded section should have a warm cream / light background.
    
    ---
    
    # 5. FOUR PRODUCT CATEGORIES
    
    Each Series must contain exactly 4 product categories.
    
    For example:
    
    URBAN CARRY
    
    → BAG
    → BACKPACK
    → BELT
    → WALLET
    
    Each category should have:
    
    CATEGORY TITLE                         View all
    
    [ Product 1 ] [ Product 2 ] [ Product 3 ] [ Product 4 ]
    
    The category title should be:
    
    * Small
    * Uppercase
    * Elegant
    * Letter-spaced
    * Premium editorial style
    
    The “View all” link should be aligned to the right.
    
    ---
    
    # 6. SHOPIFY COLLECTION DATA
    
    Do NOT hardcode product names, prices, images, or products.
    
    Use Shopify Liquid collections.
    
    Every product category must allow the merchant to select a Shopify Collection from the Shopify Theme Editor.
    
    For example:
    
    URBAN CARRY
    
    Category 1:
    BAG → Shopify Collection selector
    
    Category 2:
    BACKPACK → Shopify Collection selector
    
    Category 3:
    BELT → Shopify Collection selector
    
    Category 4:
    WALLET → Shopify Collection selector
    
    Repeat this structure for all 7 Series.
    
    The products must automatically come from the selected Shopify Collections.
    
    Use:
    
    collection.products
    
    product.title
    
    product.price
    
    product.compare_at_price
    
    product.featured_image
    
    product.url
    
    and other native Shopify product objects where appropriate.
    
    ---
    
    # 7. PRODUCT CARDS
    
    Product cards should visually resemble a premium fashion/lifestyle product catalogue.
    
    Each card must contain:
    
    * Large product image
    * Product title
    * Product price
    * Compare-at price if available
    * Optional NEW badge
    * Optional HOT badge
    * Optional product color indicators if product data supports them
    * Product image centered
    * Minimal spacing
    * No heavy borders
    * Clean light background
    
    Hover:
    
    * Slight image
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}

{% style %}
  .ai-series-explorer-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    background: {{ block.settings.section_background }};
    color: {{ block.settings.text_color }};
  }
  .ai-series-explorer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__inner { width: {{ block.settings.desktop_width_percent }}%; max-width: 100%; margin: 0 auto; }
  .ai-series-explorer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__heading { margin: 0 0 24px; font-size: clamp(24px, 3vw, 42px); letter-spacing: .12em; font-weight: 500; }
  .ai-series-explorer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__cards { display: flex; gap: 12px; overflow-x: auto; scrollbar-width: thin; padding-bottom: 12px; }
  .ai-series-explorer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card { position: relative; flex: 1 0 0; min-width: 150px; aspect-ratio: .72; overflow: hidden; border: 0; border-radius: 14px; padding: 0; background: {{ block.settings.card_background }}; cursor: pointer; text-align: left; color: #fff; }
  .ai-series-explorer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card img, .ai-series-explorer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__placeholder { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; display: block; transition: transform .45s ease; }
  .ai-series-explorer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card:hover img { transform: scale(1.05); }
  .ai-series-explorer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__placeholder { background: {{ block.settings.card_background }}; }
  .ai-series-explorer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card:after { content: ''; position: absolute; inset: 35% 0 0; background: linear-gradient(transparent, rgba(0,0,0,.72)); }
  .ai-series-explorer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card-title { position: absolute; z-index: 1; bottom: 16px; left: 16px; right: 10px; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: .08em; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .ai-series-explorer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__panel { display: none; margin-top: 28px; padding: clamp(24px, 5vw, 64px); background: {{ block.settings.panel_background }}; overflow: hidden; }
  .ai-series-explorer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__panel.is-active { display: block; }
  .ai-series-explorer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__panel-head { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 20px; align-items: flex-start; margin-bottom: 42px; }
  .ai-series-explorer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__series-name { margin: 0 0 10px; font-size: clamp(30px, 5vw, 64px); letter-spacing: .08em; font-weight: 500; }
  .ai-series-explorer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__description { margin: 0; color: {{ block.settings.muted_color }}; font-size: 17px; }
  .ai-series-explorer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__close { border: 1px solid {{ block.settings.text_color }}; background: transparent; color: {{ block.settings.text_color }}; border-radius: 50%; width: 36px; height: 36px; cursor: pointer; font-size: 22px; line-height: 1; }
  .ai-series-explorer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__category { margin-top: 32px; }
  .ai-series-explorer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__category-head { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(64,20,16,.18); padding-bottom: 10px; }
  .ai-series-explorer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__category-title { margin: 0; font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: .18em; }
  .ai-series-explorer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__view-all { color: inherit; font-size: 12px; text-decoration: underline; }
  .ai-series-explorer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__products { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); gap: 16px; margin-top: 16px; }
  .ai-series-explorer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__product { color: inherit; text-decoration: none; min-width: 0; }
  .ai-series-explorer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__product-image { position: relative; aspect-ratio: 1 / 1.18; overflow: hidden; background: {{ block.settings.card_background }}; }
  .ai-series-explorer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__product-image img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: contain; transition: transform .35s ease; }
  .ai-series-explorer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__product:hover img { transform: scale(1.04); }
  .ai-series-explorer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__badge { position: absolute; top: 10px; left: 10px; font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: .1em; background: {{ block.settings.badge_background }}; color: #fff; padding: 5px 7px; }
  .ai-series-explorer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__product-title { display: block; margin-top: 11px; font-size: 13px; }
  .ai-series-explorer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__price { margin-top: 5px; font-size: 13px; }
  .ai-series-explorer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__compare { margin-left: 6px; color: {{ block.settings.muted_color }}; text-decoration: line-through; }
  @media (max-width: 749px) {
    .ai-series-explorer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__inner { width: 100%; }
    .ai-series-explorer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__heading, .ai-series-explorer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__panel { margin-left: 16px; margin-right: 16px; }
    .ai-series-explorer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__cards { padding-left: 16px; padding-right: 16px; }
    .ai-series-explorer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card { flex: 0 0 42vw; }
    .ai-series-explorer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__products { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
  }
{% endstyle %}

<series-product-explorer-{{ ai_gen_id }} class="ai-series-explorer-{{ ai_gen_id }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
  <div class="ai-series-explorer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__inner">
    <h2 class="ai-series-explorer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__heading">{{ block.settings.heading }}</h2>
    <div class="ai-series-explorer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__cards" role="tablist">
      {% for i in (1..7) %}
        {% liquid
          assign title_key = 'series_' | append: i | append: '_title'
          assign image_key = 'series_' | append: i | append: '_image'
        %}
        <button class="ai-series-explorer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card" type="button" data-series="{{ i }}" role="tab" aria-expanded="false">
          {% if block.settings[image_key] %}<img src="{{ block.settings[image_key] | image_url: width: 900 }}" alt="{{ block.settings[title_key] | escape }}" loading="lazy">{% else %}<div class="ai-series-explorer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__placeholder">{{ 'image' | placeholder_svg_tag }}</div>{% endif %}
          <span class="ai-series-explorer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card-title">{{ block.settings[title_key] }}</span>
        </button>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
    {% for i in (1..7) %}
      {% liquid
        assign title_key = 'series_' | append: i | append: '_title'
        assign desc_key = 'series_' | append: i | append: '_description'
      %}
      <section class="ai-series-explorer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__panel" data-panel="{{ i }}" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="ai-series-explorer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__panel-head"><div><h3 class="ai-series-explorer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__series-name">{{ block.settings[title_key] }}</h3><p class="ai-series-explorer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__description">{{ block.settings[desc_key] }}</p></div><button class="ai-series-explorer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__close" type="button" aria-label="Close {{ block.settings[title_key] }}">−</button></div>
        {% for c in (1..4) %}
          {% liquid
            assign cat_key = 'series_' | append: i | append: '_category_' | append: c
            assign collection_key = 'series_' | append: i | append: '_collection_' | append: c
            assign selected_collection = block.settings[collection_key]
          %}
          <div class="ai-series-explorer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__category">
            <div class="ai-series-explorer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__category-head"><h4 class="ai-series-explorer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__category-title">{{ block.settings[cat_key] }}</h4>{% if selected_collection %}<a class="ai-series-explorer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__view-all" href="{{ selected_collection.url }}">View all</a>{% endif %}</div>
            <div class="ai-series-explorer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__products">
              {% if selected_collection %}{% for product in selected_collection.products limit: 4 %}<a class="ai-series-explorer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__product" href="{{ product.url }}"><div class="ai-series-explorer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__product-image">{% if product.tags contains 'NEW' %}<span class="ai-series-explorer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__badge">NEW</span>{% elsif product.tags contains 'HOT' %}<span class="ai-series-explorer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__badge">HOT</span>{% endif %}{% if product.featured_image %}<img src="{{ product.featured_image | image_url: width: 700 }}" alt="{{ product.featured_image.alt | default: product.title | escape }}" loading="lazy">{% endif %}</div><span class="ai-series-explorer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__product-title">{{ product.title }}</span><span class="ai-series-explorer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__price">{{ product.price | money }}{% if product.compare_at_price > product.price %}<span class="ai-series-explorer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__compare">{{ product.compare_at_price | money }}</span>{% endif %}</span></a>{% endfor %}{% endif %}
            </div>
          </div>
        {% endfor %}
      </section>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</series-product-explorer-{{ ai_gen_id }}>

<script>
(function(){
  class SeriesExplorer{{ ai_gen_id }} extends HTMLElement {
    connectedCallback(){
      this.cards=this.querySelectorAll('[data-series]'); this.panels=this.querySelectorAll('[data-panel]');
      this.cards.forEach(card=>card.addEventListener('click',()=>this.toggle(card.dataset.series)));
      this.querySelectorAll('.ai-series-explorer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__close').forEach(button=>button.addEventListener('click',()=>this.toggle(null)));
    }
    toggle(id){
      this.cards.forEach(card=>{let active=id&&card.dataset.series===id; card.setAttribute('aria-expanded',active?'true':'false');});
      this.panels.forEach(panel=>{let active=id&&panel.dataset.panel===id; panel.classList.toggle('is-active',active); panel.setAttribute('aria-hidden',active?'false':'true');});
    }
  }
  customElements.define('series-product-explorer-{{ ai_gen_id }}',SeriesExplorer{{ ai_gen_id }});
})();
</script>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "More categories explorer",
  "tag": null,
  "class": "more-categories-explorer",
  "settings": [
    {"type":"text","id":"heading","label":"Heading","default":"MORE CATEGORIES"},
    {"type":"range","id":"desktop_width_percent","label":"Desktop width","min":50,"max":100,"step":5,"unit":"%","default":100},
